<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 359)</h2>
<p><b>The share link can never go stale.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Starting a web share now clears any previous link immediately, and link creation falls back through three forms — short, long, and a direct form that needs no server at all — so the app can never show a link from an earlier session. (It could, and it did.)</li>
<li>The web clip list is now persistent: picking a clip no longer closes it. Dismiss with the ✕, G, or Esc.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
